      "id": "claim_d82f88f3daa04efeacd6ef5092f8d56e",
      "statement": "Every agent/reviewer run trigger (Slack, Linear, GitHub, dashboard, scheduler) routes through a single durable dispatch contract, agent/dispatch.py:dispatch_agent_run, which selects the graph via assistant_id ('agent' or 'reviewer') and treats source as metadata/logging only.",
