    {
      "id": "claim_45387ab772f3437e9c3a2030f69732d5",
      "statement": "The dispatch contract defaults to multitask_strategy='interrupt' (a follow-up halts and resumes the active run with full history plus the new message), durability='sync' checkpointing before each step, stream_resumable=True, stream_subgraphs=True, and a v3 compatible run shape with stream_mode list so the dashboard can attach to and observe runs it did not itself start.",
